<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">2 Petulu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda uamucivali uasonekele Petulu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petulu</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda uamucivali uasonekele</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETULU</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda uamucivali ua Petulu vausonekele kuli kanganda Petulu, vuno honi vaka kulilongesa vavengi lelo kuvatavele nguavo capua ca vusunga. Hamo nguavo muntu ueka uasonekele mu cihela ca Petulu. Muka kusoneka ahandeka nguendi uapuile mukaleho ha vuyoye vua Yesu cikuma kumani ha kuhimpuka 1:17-18 Nga Petulu ikeye uasonekele ou mukanda kumoneka ngeci uausonekelele ku Loma hakati kamiaka makumi atanu na limo na miaka itanu na mukati ka miaka makumi atanu na limo na miaka itanu na iuana 65-69 hanima yakusemuka ca Yesu, ha ntsimbu ije tele Petulu kanda atse. Petulu naua atumbula ou mukanda uendi nguendi uamucivali 3:1 vahanguile ntsimbu yaku usoneka hanima yakusoneka mukanda ua Petulu uakulivanga. Ou mukanda vausonekelele kuli vaka Kilistu voshe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petulu uasonekele ou mukanda mukutukolesa vaka kutsiliela voshe linga vayoye vuyoye vuacili na kuvanangula linga keti vakavangeye vilongesa via makuli (2) Nakuvakolesa linga vasembulule vaje vantu vali nakuhandeka nguavo Yesu nasimbula kuija. Kaha uavalekele nguendi Njambi kekusimbula vuno honi atonda muntu uoshe linga vamuyoyese 2 Petulu 3:8-9 Omu mukemo munapande kuyoya vuyoye vuacili. 3:14</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Petulu alilumbununa ikeye vavenia hamo lika na vantuama vendi 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni Petulu avavulukisa kuyoya vuyoye vuacili muomu Njambi natutavesa 1:3-21</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakuhatako Petulu anangula ha vilongesa via makuli nakuhandeka vije vikalingika kuli valongisi va makuli ku mamanusuilo 2:1-22</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Hanima yevi Petulu amanesa mukukolesa vaka kutsiliela linga vayoye vuyoye vuacili muku livuahesela kuija ca Yesu camucivali 3:1-17</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Yange Simoni Petulu, ngamba na kanganda ua Yesu Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Kuli vaje vanatambula lutsilielo luakupua hamo mukuimana nolu luetu mu vusunga vua Njambi yetu na Muyoyesi Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale muvuingi kuli yeni mu mangana a Njambi na a Yesu Muene uetu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusana na kuhangula ca Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Nzili yendi ya vusunga inatuhana viuma vioshe vije viapandama ku muono na ku vunjambi, kuhitila mu mana endi uje ua tusanene ku vumpau naku vucili vuendi, <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />vikevio vije via natuhana yetu vije viendi via seho na vikulaheso viakama, ngeci linga kuhitila muli vikevio linga muase kuteua ku vupi vuakama vuje vuli ha mavu muomu ya mashungu a vipi, kaha mukakala na mutambela mu vunjambi. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Muomu ya cuma eci pangeni na nzili yoshe muku vuezelelako ku lutsilielo lueni na vucili, na vucili na mana, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />naku mana akulihilula kaha na kulihilula ca lukakateya, na lukakateya lua vunjambi, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />kaha naku vunjambi vua cizango cavu Kilistu, kaha cizango cavu Kilistu cikale na cizango. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Muomu nga viuma evi vinapu vieni kaha muli navio muvuingi, kaha vikami lingisa kupua vaka kupanga nava kakuima vushuka mu mana eni hali Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Muomu uoshe uje ahona kukala nevi viuma napu kapuputua kaha naua muka kumuena muyehi kaha nasuvu ngeci va mulelesele ku vipi viendi via laja.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Nankuma, vamuenetu, pangeni na nzili yoshe linga mumuese kusana na kuhangula ceni, muomu nga mulinga eci kaha kumukahilukila munima, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />nankuma vakamitambula muacili mukukovela mu vumuene vua ya yaye vua Muene uetu na Muyoyesi Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Nankuma ntsimbu yoshe njikatondo ku mianukisa viuma evi, cipuevene mua vizivuka kaha va vipanga mu vusunga vuje mulinavuo. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Njasinganieka cinapu cacili, omo njicili mu muvila ou, mukumihindula na cuma ca kumianukisa, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />muomu njazivuka ngeci vuavuno njikashulula muvila ou, ngue muje mua njimueseleco Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Kaha njikalinga muoshe muje munjaselamo ngeci hanima ya kuya cange kaha mukasa kuvuluka viuma evi ntsimbu yoshe.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakaleho vaje vamuene vumpau vua Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Muomu ku tuakavele visimo viakuhuma ku vantu omo tuambuilile kuli yeni nzili na kuija ca Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, vuno honi tuapuile tu vakaleho va vumuene vuendi. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Muomu muje muatambuile kasingimiko na vumpau kuhuma kuli Njambi Tate na lizi liahumine kuli uje Muene ua Vumpau nguendi, “Ou ikeye munange injazanga, muli ikeye njivuahelela,” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Tuovuile eli lizi lihuma muilu, muomu tuakele nendi ha munkinda ua kulela. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Kaha tuli na lizi lia vunanguizi lia vusunga cikuma. Mukalinga muacili kuhakela mana kuli eci ngue ku ndeya ije ilinakutuila ceke mu cihela ca milima, kuvanga noho kukutuhuka ca litangua kaha na ntanga ntanga ya cimene ihinduka mu mitima yeni. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Cakulivanga ku vioshe munapande kuzivuka eci, ngeci kukuesi vunanguizi vua visoneka vuje vuezile omo ya kunungulula ca muntu likaliendi, <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />muomu kukuesi vunanguizi vuahumine ku cizango ca muntu, vuno honi vantu va vendesele na Cimbembesi Uakulela uje uahandekele via kuhuma kuli Njambi.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Valongisi vamakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Vuno honi tunanguizi va makuli navakevo naua vasholokele hakati ka vantu, ngue muje mukukakala naua valongisi va makuli hakati keni, vaje mu vushueke vakaneha via kunongesa, na ku muviana Muene uje uavalandele, vakalinehela vakevo vavenia via kunonga ca vuasi vuasi. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Kaha vavengi vakakava vingila viavo via vupi, kaha muomu yavo ngila ya vusunga ikapua ya makuli. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Kaha muomu yalizangamena liavo vakamikuisa na mezi a makuli, muomu cihiso cavo calaja hanga ca vavandamena, kaha kunonga cavo hanga kucili.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Muomu nga Njambi katetelele vaje tungelo omo valingile vupi, vuno honi uavombilile mu ngehena na kuvahaka mu cina ca milima oku vanavakutu na malienge kuvandamena cisompelo, <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />nga katetelele mavu a laja, vuno honi ua yoyesele Noua, muka kuambulula vusunga, na vantu vakuavo vatanu na vavali, omo uanehele livazi ha mavu a vantu vaje vakuhona kutsiliela, <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />nga uatenguluile vinganda via Sondoma na Ngomola kuvipuisa muto uavihisile na kuvipuisa vimueso kuli vaje vaka kuhona kutsiliela, <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />kaha nga uayoyesele muka vusunga Lote, uje uayandele cikuma muomu ya futisi ya vaka vupi <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />(muomu vati yala uje muka vusunga ua muene na kuvua omo uayoyele hakati kavo, uayandele mu vusunga vua muono uendi ha litangua na litangua na vilinga viavo via vipi), <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />ambahoni Muene azivuka mua kuyoyesela vaka vusunga ku vieseko, na kuhaka vaka vupi muintsi ya kashitiko noho kuvanga litangua lia kusompa, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />kaha cikumani vaje valina kulikovelesa mu mashungu amapi na kushaula nzili yakama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Mukusimpa na mukulivua, kuvesi na liova lia kushaula vaje vali na vumpau, <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />cipue tungelo vaje vali na nzili yakama kaha naua vali na nzili, kuvekuhandeka via kushaula via kusompa kuli vakevo ku mesho a Muene. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Vuno honi ava vanapu ngue tusitu va mu musenge, via kutanga via kuhona mana vasemukilile kuvakuata na kuvatsiha, mukushaula vimpande vije kuvazivuka, vaka vanongesa mu cifua cimo cije civakanonga vakevo, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />vakayanda muamupi muomu ya vilinga viavo via vipi. Vaka citanda ngue senga mukulisamba mutania muelu oku valinga vupi. Vakevo vakevua shuamua na kupihilila omo valipandakana neni ha kulia oku kuvuahelela cavo cinapu ca makuli. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Mesho avo apua akushula na vupangala, kaha vakala na cashu ca kulinga vupi. Vakatuamenena vantu kulinga vupi. Mitima yavo yapua yakulilongesa kulinga lizangamena. Vapua vana vakusinga! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Vanaseze ngila ya cili kaha vanayi mungila yeka, vanakava ngila ya Mbalame, muna Mbeole, uje uazangele kutsimana hakulinga viuma via vipi, <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />vuno honi vamutenukilile ha vupi vuendi vavenia, cimulu uakaveveve uahandekele mulizi lia vuntu kaha naua uavindikile kuzaluka ca kananguizi.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Vantu ava vanapu ngue mavuelu vuelu akuhona mema, naua ngue mbundu ije ivanapekumuna na linkimba, muomu vakevo vanavavuahesela cihela ca milima cikuma. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Muomu, vakahandeka mezi akulihalesa a ngoco, kaha vakapangesa mashungu a mapi ku vantu vaje vanateua kuli vaje vali nakuyoya mu vupi. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Va vakulahesa kupatuka, vuno honi vakevo vavenia vanapu va ndungo va futisi ya kunonga, muomu coshe cije cihiana muntu cikeco cimupuisa vundungo. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Muomu nga vanaputumuka ku vinzili via vipi via ha mavu kuhitila mu mana a Muene na Muyoyesi uetu Yesu Kilistu, kaha vanavakuata naua na kuvafungula, mamanusuilo avo akapua amapi cikuma kupulakana ha kulivanga. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Nga capuile cacili kuli vakevo ngue kuvazivukile ngila ya vusunga kupulakana hanima ya kuzivuka vusunga na kuhiluka munima ku kulela kua lishiko livavahanene. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Calingiuile kuli vakevo kuya ku cisimo ca vusunga cije cihandeka nguaco, katali akali vishanjo viendi vavenia, kaha ngulu uje ivanatanesa akahilukila naua na kulilomba mu mandova.<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Cikulaheso ha kuija ca Muene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Ou honi unapu mukanda ua mucivali uje njinasonekela kuli yeni, vanjazanga, kaha mu mikanda yoshe ivali njinahindula viyongola via mana eni mukumivulukisa, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />linga muase kuvuluka mezi aje vahandekele tunanguizi vakulela na lishiko lia Muene na Muyoyesi kuhitila mu tunganda veni. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Cakulivanga kuvioshe munapande kuvuisisa eci, vaka kushendumuna vakeja mu matangua a mamanusuilo na kushendumuna, vaka kavangeya mashungu avo <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />kaha vakahandeka nguavo, “Nkuma cikulaheso ca kuija cendi cili kuli? Hume haje ha vatsililile vakukuluila vetu, viuma vioshe viatualelelaho kupua ngue mu viakelelemo ku maputukilo akutanga.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Vanayengula vusunga ovu, ngeci kuhitila ha lizi lia Njambi melu akeleko kuntsenkulu, kaha mavu a humine ha mema kuhitila mu mema, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />kuhitila mu mavu aje akeleko aje ahuile na mema kaha a nongele. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Vuno honi kuhitila mu lizi limo vene melu na mavu aua aliko honi vana atumbikila tuhia, mavu aua vanatulika noho litangua lia kusompa na kunongesa ca vantu vakuhona kutsiliela.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Vuno honi vamuanetu keti muecele vusunga vumo, ngeci kuli Muene litangua limo liapua miaka likulukazi, kaha miaka likulukazi yapua ngue litangua limo kuli Muene. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Muene kekusimbula ha cikulaheso cendi ngue vamo mu vaka singaniekelamo, vuno honi uapua ua kusimpa hali yeni kekutonda cipue umo linga akanonge, vuno honi akatondo voshe vatenguluke.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Vuno honi litangua lia Muene likeja ngue muizi, ambahoni melu a kahita na cililimo cakama, kaha na viuma via muilu vioshe vika sangunuka na tuhia, kaha mavu na vipangi viliho vaka viuemeka. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Muomu viuma vioshe evi vika sangunuka, nkuma mukapua vantu va cifua muka? Munapande kuyoya vuyoye vua kulela na vunjambi, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />kuvandamena na kuzambuisa kuija ca litangua lia Njambi, muomu melu a kanonga na kusangunuka, na viuma vioshe vika sangunuka na tuhia! <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Vuno honi kuya ha cikulaheso cendi tuli nakuvandamena melu a maha na mavu a maha muje vusunga mukemo muvuakala.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Nankuma, vamuanetu, muomu muli nakuvandamena evi, esekeni cikuma linga akamiuane cakuhona katoma cipue mulonga, vuno honi mu ciyulo. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Kaha singaniekeni ngueni kusimpa ca Muene uetu cikeco kuovoka. Mu cifua cimo vene na muanetu utuazanga Paulu uamisonekelele kuya ku mana a vamuhanene kuli Njambi, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />omu mukemuo muakahandekela mu mikanda yendi yoshe. Muli vimo mukati ka mikanda yendi vije via vikalu kuvivuisisa, vije vaka nzimba na vaka kuhona mana vaka vitengulula na kulituala kukunonga vakevo vavenia, ngue mu vakalingi ku visoneka vikuavo. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Nankuma vamuanetu, omo munazivuka evi kanda vicije zangameni keti ngoconi vakamiambata na kapenga ka vantu vakuhona mashiko linga muue mukukolesa ceni. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Vuno honi koleni mu kavumbi na mana a Muene uetu na Muyoyesi Yesu Kilistu. Kuli ikeye kukale vumpau ha ntsimbu ino na ku litangua lije liayaye! Ameni.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>